Wraith is not The Batman, they are actually very different from one another. Only similarities being they wear black, do some detective work, live in a crime filled city and are superheroes without super powers.

Some&nbsp;very major differences;
<ul><li>Batman is darker than Wraith.</li><li>Batman focuses on close quarters combat, only relying on ranged attacks when needed. Wraith is a ranged combatant that only uses melee attacks when someone manages to get close to her.</li><li>Batman prefers working alone. Wraith likes working with the Freedom Five.</li><li>Batman isn&#39;t really a good name. Wraith on the other hand has a great name.</li><li>Batman&#39;s parents are dead. Wraith&#39;s are alive.</li><li>They both have completely different personalities.</li></ul>
&nbsp;

Does Wraith draw some inspiration from Batman? Sure, but she is still a very unique hero that merely shares the archetype with Batman.

As for having something to deal with Adaptive Plating, she has Grappling Hook.

